<!-- FAQs Section -->
<section id="faq" class="py-12 bg-ink-50/60 border-t border-ink-200/60">
  <div class="container max-w-4xl">
    <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-2xl text-ink-900 mb-6 text-center">
      Outstation Rental FAQs
    </h2>
    <div class="space-y-4">
      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-ink-100 p-5 shadow-xs">
        <p class="font-display font-semibold text-ink-900 text-[15px]">
          How does doorstep pickup work for outstation trips in Bangalore?
        </p>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-ink-600 leading-relaxed">
          Yogi Tours &amp; Travels provides 100% confirmed doorstep pickup from any apartment, gated community, tech park, or hotel across Bangalore — including Whitefield, Electronic City, Koramangala, Indiranagar, Hebbal, and Kempegowda Airport (BLR). Your assigned vehicle and chauffeur arrive at your preferred departure time.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-ink-100 p-5 shadow-xs">
        <p class="font-display font-semibold text-ink-900 text-[15px]">
          What vehicles are available for outstation rental?
        </p>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-ink-600 leading-relaxed">
          Our fleet includes sedans (Swift Dzire), family MUVs &amp; SUVs (Maruti Ertiga, Toyota Innova, Innova Crysta, Innova Hycross, Fortuner), premium group vans (Force Urbania, Urbania 12-Seater Maharaja, 9/12/17-Seater Tempo Travellers), and heavy coaches (21/25-Seater Mini Buses, 40/55-Seater Tourist Coaches).
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-ink-100 p-5 shadow-xs">
        <p class="font-display font-semibold text-ink-900 text-[15px]">
          Are toll charges, state permits, and driver Bata included in the tariff?
        </p>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-ink-600 leading-relaxed">
          We provide completely transparent itemized billing. The base per-km rate and driver Bata are fixed up front. Interstate permit charges (for Tamil Nadu, Kerala, Andhra Pradesh, Goa) and highway tolls can either be all-inclusive or charged as actuals, documented clearly in your quotation with GST invoice.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-ink-100 p-5 shadow-xs">
        <p class="font-display font-semibold text-ink-900 text-[15px]">
          Can I book a one-way outstation drop from Bangalore?
        </p>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-ink-600 leading-relaxed">
          Yes, we operate one-way drops as well as round trips and multi-day holiday circuits from Bangalore to Coorg, Mysore, Ooty, Wayanad, Tirupati, Chennai, Pondicherry, and all major cities.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

